Varieties -- affine and projective algebraic geometry
*****************************************************

Description
===========

This package provides routines for working with affine and projective varieties
and coherent sheaves on them.

Acknowledgement
===============

Large portions of this package were originally in m2/varieties.m2. Work on the
type *note SheafMap: SheafMap, and related algorithms began at a Macaulay2
workshop (see https://aimath.org/pastworkshops/macaulay2efie.html ) at the
American Institute of Mathematics (see https://aimath.org ) in September 2023.

Contributors
============

Claudiu Raicu (see https://www3.nd.edu/~craicu/ ) contributed to the
development of this package.

See also
========

  * *note Schubert2: (Schubert2)Top, -- characteristic classes for varieties
    without equations
  * *note GKMVarieties: (GKMVarieties)Top, -- computations with GKM manifolds
    and moment graphs
  * *note NormalToricVarieties: (NormalToricVarieties)Top, -- routines for
    working with normal toric varieties and related objects
  * *note AbstractToricVarieties: (AbstractToricVarieties)Top, -- links
    abstract simplicial (normal) toric varieties to Schubert2
  * *note MultiprojectiveVarieties: (MultiprojectiveVarieties)Top, --
    multi-projective varieties and multi-rational maps
* Menu:

* Variety::                     the class of all algebraic varieties
* AffineVariety::               the class of all affine varieties
* ProjectiveVariety::           the class of all projective varieties
* CoherentSheaf::               the class of all coherent sheaves
* SheafOfRings::                the class of sheaves of rings
* SumOfTwists::                 the class of all sums of twists
* SheafMap::                    the class of morphisms of coherent sheaves

