SumOfTwists -- the class of all sums of twists
**********************************************

Description
===========

This class is used internally as an abstract representation of a graded module
as an infinite direct sum of twists of a coherent sheaf.
+---------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y,z]                           |
|                                             |
|o1 = R                                       |
|                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                          |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i2 : X = Proj R                              |
|                                             |
|o2 = X                                       |
|                                             |
|o2 : ProjectiveVariety                       |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i3 : OO_X(*)                                 |
|                                             |
|        1                                    |
|o3 = OO   (*)                                |
|       X                                     |
|                                             |
|o3 : SumOfTwists                             |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i4 : peek oo                                 |
|                                             |
|                    1                        |
|o4 = SumOfTwists{OO  , LowerBound{-infinity}}|
|                   X                         |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i5 : OO_X(>=2)                               |
|                                             |
|        1                                    |
|o5 = OO  (>= 2)                              |
|       X                                     |
|                                             |
|o5 : SumOfTwists                             |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i6 : peek oo                                 |
|                                             |
|                    1                        |
|o6 = SumOfTwists{OO  , LowerBound{2}}        |
|                   X                         |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i7 : Ext^0(OO_X^1, OO_X^1)                   |
|                                             |
|       1                                     |
|o7 = QQ                                      |
|                                             |
|o7 : QQ-module, free                         |
+---------------------------------------------+
|i8 : Ext^0(OO_X^1, OO_X^1(*))                |
|                                             |
|      1                                      |
|o8 = R                                       |
|                                             |
|o8 : R-module, free                          |
+---------------------------------------------+

