|0  |                                                                         |
|0  |                                                                         |
|0  |                                                                         |
|0  |                                                                         |
|0  |                                                                         |
|0  |                                                                         |
|0  |                                                                         |
|0  |                                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : prune K2                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = cokernel {1} | c2 bd ac b2 |                                            |
|              {2} | d  c  b  a  |                                            |
|                                                                             |
|                                         1           1                       |
|o6 : coherent sheaf on X, quotient of OO  (-1) ++ OO  (-2)                   |
|                                        X           X                        |
