  * Outputs:
      * a *note coherent sheaf: CoherentSheaf,, the twist of F on a projective
        variety by the n-th power of the hyperplane line bundle.

Description
===========

+----------------------------------------+
|i1 : X = Proj(QQ[x,y,z])                |
|                                        |
|o1 = X                                  |
|                                        |
|o1 : ProjectiveVariety                  |
+----------------------------------------+
|i2 : F = OO_X                           |
|                                        |
|o2 = OO                                 |
|       X                                |
|                                        |
|o2 : SheafOfRings                       |
