cotangentSheaf(ZZ,ProjectiveVariety) -- exterior powers of the cotangent sheaf of a projective variety
******************************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note cotangentSheaf: cotangentSheaf,
  * Usage: 
        cotangentSheaf(p, X)
  * Inputs:
      * p, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * X, a *note projective variety: ProjectiveVariety,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note MinimalGenerators: cotangentSheaf, => a *note Boolean value:
        (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, default value true, whether to *note prune:
        (Macaulay2Doc)prune, the result before returning it
      * *note Strategy: cotangentSheaf, => ..., default value null, cotangent
        sheaf of a projective variety
  * Outputs:
      * a *note coherent sheaf: CoherentSheaf,, 

Description
===========

This function computes the $p$-th exterior power of the *note cotangent sheaf:
cotangentSheaf, of a projective variety $X$, usually denoted $\Omega_X^p$.

As an example we compute $h^{1,1}$ on a K3 surface (a quartic in projective
threespace):

+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : K3 = Proj QQ[x_0..x_3]/(x_0^4+x_1^4+x_2^4+x_3^4-11*x_0*x_1*x_2*x_3)|
|                                                                        |
|o1 = K3                                                                 |
|                                                                        |
|o1 : ProjectiveVariety                                                  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : omega1 = cotangentSheaf(1, K3);                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : HH^1(omega1)                                                       |
|                                                                        |
|       20                                                               |
|o3 = QQ                                                                 |
|                                                                        |
|o3 : QQ-module, free                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+

As a second example we compute *note Hodge numbers: hh, of the Fermat quintic
in projective fourspace:

+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : FermatQuintic = Proj QQ[x_0..x_4]/(x_0^5+x_1^5+x_2^5+x_3^5+x_4^5)|
|                                                                      |
|o4 = FermatQuintic                                                    |
|                                                                      |
|o4 : ProjectiveVariety                                                |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : omega1 = cotangentSheaf(1, FermatQuintic);                       |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : HH^1(omega1)                                                     |
|                                                                      |
|       1                                                              |
|o6 = QQ                                                               |
|                                                                      |
|o6 : QQ-module, free                                                  |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : HH^2(omega1)                                                     |
|                                                                      |
|       101                                                            |
|o7 = QQ                                                               |
|                                                                      |
|o7 : QQ-module, free                                                  |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : omega2 = cotangentSheaf(2, FermatQuintic);                       |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : HH^1(omega2)                                                     |
|                                                                      |
|       101                                                            |
|o9 = QQ                                                               |
|                                                                      |
|o9 : QQ-module, free                                                  |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : HH^2(omega2)                                                    |
|                                                                      |
|        1                                                             |
|o10 = QQ                                                              |
|                                                                      |
|o10 : QQ-module, free                                                 |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+

