eulers(CoherentSheaf)
*********************

  * Function: *note eulers: (Macaulay2Doc)eulers,
  * Usage: 
        eulers E
  * Inputs:
      * E, a *note coherent sheaf: CoherentSheaf,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, the successive sectional Euler
        characteristics of a coherent sheaf, or a module.

Description
===========

Computes a list of the successive sectional Euler characteristics of a coherent
sheaf, the i-th entry on the list being the Euler characteristic of the i-th
generic hyperplane restriction of E


The Horrocks-Mumford bundle on the projective fourspace:
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x_0..x_4];                                      |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : a = {1,0,0,0,0}                                        |
|                                                            |
|o2 = {1, 0, 0, 0, 0}                                        |
|                                                            |
|o2 : List                                                   |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : b = {0,1,0,0,1}                                        |
|                                                            |
|o3 = {0, 1, 0, 0, 1}                                        |
|                                                            |
|o3 : List                                                   |
+------------------------------------------------------------+
