    resolution of a module or ideal
  * *note Tor: (Macaulay2Doc)Tor, -- Tor module
  * *note Hom: (Macaulay2Doc)Hom, -- module of homomorphisms
  * *note HH: (Macaulay2Doc)HH, -- general homology and cohomology functor
  * *note sheafExt: sheafExt, -- sheaf extension of coherent sheaves

