|i2 : I = idealSheaf X                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = image | x4+y4+z4 |                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                   1         |
|o2 : coherent sheaf on Proj(QQ[x..z]), subsheaf of OO                        |
|                                                     Proj(QQ[x..z])          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : rho = inducedMap((ambient I)/I, ambient I) --induced inclusion of ideal |
|                                                                             |
|                                                      1                      |
|o3 = cokernel | x4+y4+z4 | <--------- OO                                     |
|                              | 1 |     Proj(QQ[x..z])                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : SheafMap                                                                |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|sheaf into structure sheaf of ambient ring                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : for i to 2 list HH^i(image rho)                                         |
|                                                                             |
|        1    3                                                               |
|o4 = {QQ , QQ , 0}                                                           |
|                                                                             |
