========================

  * *note minimalPresentation(CoherentSheaf):
    minimalPresentation_lpCoherentSheaf_rp, -- minimal presentation of a
    coherent sheaf or sheaf map
  * "minimalPresentation(SheafMap)"
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

