|o2 = X                                  |
|                                        |
|o2 : ProjectiveVariety                  |
+----------------------------------------+
|i3 : f = sheafHom(OO_X, OO_X)           |
|                                        |
|        1                               |
|o3 = OO                                 |
|       X                                |
|                                        |
|o3 : coherent sheaf on X, free of rank 1|
+----------------------------------------+
|i4 : g = f ^ 2                          |
|                                        |
|        2                               |
|o4 = OO                                 |
|       X                                |
|                                        |
|o4 : coherent sheaf on X, free of rank 2|
+----------------------------------------+

